        "label": "Hiring a team",
        "body": "# Four seats, one budget\nThe **Choice Ladder** picks a team from the shortlist: salaries within $560k, four seats, at least one senior and at most one contractor.\n\nPriya was promised a seat, so she is a **Must**; Sam withdrew, so he is a **Never**. Marcus and Lena won't work together (**Excludes**), and Tomás needs Aiko to mentor him (**Requires**). Where two candidates score close, the ladder forks; pick a side and the plan follows.",
        "color": "violet",
        "width": 440,
        "height": 300
      }
    },
